   well, i've just finished recompiling NetHack, and i decided to try some
hacking of my own and created a new character class : i was finding the game
a bit easy so i now have no special abilities (well, just tool identification
unless that proves too useful - i just found a magic flute on my first test
game!), low hit points, no high stats (is there a way to have all low stats ?
(and how does _attribs dist_ actually work ?)).
 also i start only with an amulet of restful sleep, a leash and sack (it's
supposed to be some sort of hobo/crusty).

   so, i was wondering if anyone out there (with a better imagination and/or
some programming skills) had managed to create new and interesting objects
for their characters which they would care to share with the Net?

